---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CookieBanner from "../components/CookieBanner.astro";
import { DEFAULT_LOCALE, getDir, type Locale } from "../i18n/locales";
import { t } from "../i18n/ui";
import { pageTitle } from "../i18n/title";

type Props = { locale?: Locale };
const locale = Astro.props.locale ?? DEFAULT_LOCALE;
const dir = getDir(locale);
const aboutDescription =
	"Libertta is a technology and learning-focused blog built for people who enjoy exploring ideas, solving problems, and building things.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang={locale} dir={dir}>
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={pageTitle(locale, "nav.about")}
			description={aboutDescription}
			locale={locale}
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header locale={locale} />
		<main>
			<article>
				<h1>{t(locale, "nav.about")}</h1>

				<p>
					<strong
						>Libertta is a technology and learning-focused blog built for people who enjoy
						exploring ideas, solving problems, and building things.</strong
					>
				</p>

				<p>
					The platform brings together practical exercises, technology insights, tutorials,
					development tips, project experiences, and research-minded articles designed to turn
					knowledge into something useful. Rather than focusing only on theory, Libertta
					encourages readers to experiment, test ideas, learn from mistakes, and apply what they
					discover to real projects.
				</p>

				<p>
					Our content covers a broad range of topics across
					<strong
						>software development, emerging technologies, artificial intelligence, digital tools,
						programming, engineering, innovation, and practical problem-solving</strong
					>. Articles may range from simple exercises and technical explanations to deeper
					explorations of technologies, workflows, tools, and ideas shaping the digital world.
				</p>

				<p>
					Libertta also serves as a space for sharing
					<strong>experiences, observations, experiments, and lessons learned</strong>. Some
					articles are created to explain a concept clearly, while others investigate a
					technology, document a project, compare approaches, or provide practical guidance for
					readers who want to try something themselves.
				</p>

				<p>
					The platform is designed for a diverse audience, including
					<strong
						>students, developers, researchers, makers, entrepreneurs, technology enthusiasts, and
						curious learners</strong
					>. Whether you are looking for a programming exercise, trying to understand a new
					technology, searching for a practical solution, or simply exploring an interesting idea,
					Libertta aims to provide useful and accessible content.
				</p>

				<h2>A Place to Learn by Doing</h2>
				<p>
					We believe that some of the most valuable learning happens through practice. That is why
					Libertta combines explanations with exercises, examples, experiments, and practical
					perspectives whenever possible.
				</p>
				<p>Our goal is simple:</p>
				<p>
					<strong
						>Learn something useful. Explore the idea. Try it yourself. Build something better.</strong
					>
				</p>

				<h2>Technology, Ideas &amp; Research</h2>
				<p>
					Technology changes quickly, and understanding it requires more than simply following
					trends. Libertta aims to look beyond the surface by exploring
					<strong
						>how technologies work, why they matter, where they can be useful, and what can be
						learned from using them</strong
					>.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our research-minded approach does not mean every article is an academic paper. Instead,
					it means approaching interesting subjects with curiosity, evidence, experimentation, and
					a willingness to examine different perspectives.
				</p>

				<h2>Multilingual &amp; Accessible</h2>
				<p>
					Libertta is designed to support readers from different backgrounds and regions. The
					platform provides
					<strong
						>multiple-language support for navigation, interface elements, and selected content</strong
					>, making the experience more accessible to an international audience.
				</p>

				<h2>Our Purpose</h2>
				<p>
					Libertta exists to create a growing knowledge space where
					<strong
						>ideas can be explored, practical skills can be developed, and useful discoveries can
						be shared</strong
					>.
				</p>
				<p>
					We are building a place where a small exercise can become a learning experience, a
					technical problem can become a tutorial, an experiment can become an insight, and an
					interesting idea can become the starting point for a new project.
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Libertta — Learn. Explore. Build. Share.</strong>
				</p>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer locale={locale} />
		<CookieBanner locale={locale} />
	</body>
</html>
